Hermes patch: a browser read names the tab it came from, and a slow page is still loading, not a failed one.
Base: 74943bb889 on Alien. Apply after the other Zero Hermes patches (it sits next to hermes-browser-person-check.patch).
Not applied by the normal deploy: apply by hand, then restart taffy-gateway.
Friction list item 20 (Nov 16 2026, Scholar): "navigation repeatedly reported failure even though the requested page loaded;
other checks showed a FlatWorld address with Cairn content." Test: hub/tests/test_browser_one_tab.py.

